                        "glosses": [
                            "to cut (hair, fur, grass, etc.), to shear, to clip, to trim"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "imperfective"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33dad0c3-127b-418c-ae87-11f1c7a47534",
                                "sense_id": "750c4083-9980-3757-9439-9e283e472ba5",
                                "text": "он засу́нул в карма́н миниатю́рные но́жницы, кото́рыми, наве́рное, франтик по утрам стрижёт но́гти, и ― бро́сился\non zasúnul v karmán miniatjúrnyje nóžnicy, kotórymi, navérnoje, frantik po utram strižót nógti, i ― brósilsja",
                                "translation": "he slipped in his pocket (a pair) of miniature scissors with which, probably, the dandy cut his nails in the morning, and ran away",
